📋 DOCUMENTATION USAGE IN RAG-LLM PIPELINE

Understanding How Each Field Is Used:

Field
Embedding
LLM Stage
Purpose
@title
Embedding1
Function Selection
Part of function signature
@description
Embedding1
Function Selection
LLM decides which function to use
@section User Queries
Embedding2
RAG Retrieval
Natural language entry point
@usage
-
Code Generation
Auto-generated from function definition
