Validation for Visualization Functions

Additional checks for gpdb_plot_* functions:

# Check if function uses academic theme
if grep -q ".gpdb_theme_default\\|theme_bw" R/<vis_function>.R; then
  echo "✓ Uses publication theme"
else
  echo "⚠ Warning: Not using standard theme - consider .gpdb_theme_default()"
